{
  "doc": [
    "The shared oracle for where a run of tool cards ends in a turn's own lane. The client half is",
    "static-src/messages-blocks.ts indexGroups (through entryRenders, read off the rendered groups) and",
    "the server half is internal/chat's toolCardRuns, which hiddenHookIDs filters find by. Each reader",
    "builds its own entries from these cases.",
    "",
    "body lists the turn's entries after its turn_open, in order; lane is \"\" when absent. runs lists",
    "the chat lane's tool-card runs in order, each by its call ids. lane_runs, when present, lists",
    "each delegate lane's runs the same way, as that delegate's own page draws them; a delegate lane",
    "with a tool call is always listed. later_wake, when present, is a turn_wake payload recorded in a",
    "later turn of the same chat. pane_runs, when present, is what a workflow run's tab draws instead",
    "of runs: the tab is its own surface, where every mention of a run seats on its card.",
    "",
    "Every tool call here is a plain command, a read, a steering box, a delegate's invocation or a",
    "mention of a workflow run, and only an invocation or a mention that seats on the run's card ends",
    "a run, so the cases measure boundaries alone; which hooks a boundary hides is",
    "hook_visibility_test.go's."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
